# Used for the GitHub Pages build (`npm run deploy:pages`).
# GitHub Pages only serves static files — it cannot run the Express backend,
# Postgres, or Redis. Deploy the backend separately (Render/Railway/Fly.io all
# have free tiers) and point this at that URL before deploying the frontend.
#
# Copy this file to `.env.production` and fill in your real backend URL:
VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend-url.example.com
